                "content": "### Get notified on your phone\n\nAlerts are sent through the free **ntfy** app when the A5 gets genuinely bad\n(more than 10 minutes over the normal time, or when Google starts routing around it).\nQuiet days stay quiet: there's no message for small fluctuations.\n\n[![Get it on Google Play](/public/img/a5/google.png)](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=io.heckel.ntfy)\n&nbsp;\n[![Download on the App Store](/public/img/a5/apple.png)](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ntfy/id1625396347)\n\n1. Install the app\n2. Tap **+** to subscribe to a topic\n3. Enter the topic name:\n\n### `towcestera5alerts`\n\n![Subscribe screen](/public/img/a5/screen.png)\n\n---\n\n[Open the route in Google Maps](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/52.122268,-0.973021/52.066852,-0.8714004)\n",
